fields.EN:
(We have everything we need for a perfect beach date,
 yet Oyayubihime and I have been arguing like this
 for a good twenty minutes...)

fields.LOCALIZED:
(We have the recipe for the perfect date,
but Thumbelina and I have been bickering
for twenty minutes.)

fields.EN:
Oyayubihime, I want you to stay with me
from now on too. I love you,
and I need you in my life.

Still, when I think that happiness is waiting for me
if I keep doing my best,
working hard doesn't feel like a burden at all.

(Ah, she's cute... I guess you could call it the weakness
of being in love. I'm completely head over heels
for Cinderella too...)

